{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GEaqNBdo2pHwvhSsX5MvVv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All files are implemented and `go vet ./pkg/sys/` passes with no diagnostics.\n\n**Summary of what was implemented:**\n\n- **`pkg/sys/fileinfo.go`** — Portable `FileInfo` struct (prd002-sys R2.2) with all extended metadata fields (Mode, Size, Nlink, Uid, Gid, Rdev, Dev, Ino, Blocks, Blksize, ModTime, Info) and an `Lstat` wrapper that calls `os.Lstat` and populates platform-specific fields via `fillFromStat`.\n\n- **`pkg/sys/fileinfo_darwin.go`** — Darwin-specific `fillFromStat` using `Mtimespec` for modification time and explicit casts for Darwin's narrower types (uint16 Nlink, int32 Dev/Rdev, int32 Blksize).\n\n- **`pkg/sys/fileinfo_linux.go`** — Linux-specific `fillFromStat` using `Mtim` for modification time with explicit casts that handle both amd64 and arm64 type differences.\n\n- **`pkg/sys/terminal.go`** — `TerminalSize() (columns int, rows int, err error)` via TIOCGWINSZ ioctl on stdout using `golang.org/x/sys/unix`.\n\n**Acceptance criteria verification:**\n- AC1: `fileinfo.go` defines `FileInfo` with ModTime and Blocks, plus `Lstat` wrapper\n- AC2: `fileinfo_darwin.go` extracts ModTime from `Mtimespec` and Blocks from Darwin Stat_t\n- AC3: `fileinfo_linux.go` extracts ModTime from `Mtim` and Blocks from Linux Stat_t\n- AC4: `terminal.go` exports `TerminalSize` returning columns, rows, error\n- AC5: `go vet ./pkg/sys/` passes with no diagnostics"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":52640,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a3f81b6-6b79-40af-875b-429ca2fae42c","uuid":"789fbc5e-69de-4f33-818c-935b0ac31adb"}
